  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Coffee Rehabilitation and Production Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Coffee Beneficiaries: The project will directly and indirectly impact more than 2,268 rural people of which the project will directly impact more than 400 women. Description: Marangu East AMCOS seeks to revamp and increase the production, productivity and quality of mild arabica coffee. This will be attained by planting new more high yielding compact variety using best agricultural practices that take into account the need to embrace sustainable landscape approach.</narrative>
  </description>
